RULE_VERSION: 1.0
RULE_NAME: AI_MEETING_ASSISTANT
APP_TYPE: AI
TARGET: PI_SOLOHOST
GOAL: A meeting assistant that turns notes into summary and action items.

REQUIRED CAPABILITIES:
- Meeting notes
- AI summarization
- Action items
- Meeting history
EXECUTION:
  MAX_CYCLES: 10
  MAX_TASKS: 20
  MAX_RETRIES_PER_TASK: 1
  AUTO_APPLY: true
  VERIFY_EACH_TASK: true
  STOP_ON_USER_ACTION: true

DEFINITION_OF_DONE:
- Meeting notes can be created
- AI summary works with configured provider
- Action items are generated
- Meeting history persists
- SoloHost runtime starts successfully
